GameMarket MVP Roadmap
Project idea
GameMarket is a simple Blocket-inspired marketplace for video games where users can browse, filter, view, create, update, and delete game listings.
The project is built as a hobby and learning project to practice modern full-stack development, API design, authentication, authorization, database integration, and frontend/backend communication.
The goal is to create a functional MVP rather than a complete production marketplace.

