NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

Backend environment file
backend/.env

Contains values such as:
PORT=5000
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...
JWT_SECRET=...

Environment files must not be committed to Git.
Data flow
Frontend
→ Fetch request
→ Express API
→ Controller
→ Service
→ Repository
→ Prisma
→ PostgreSQL

The frontend no longer depends on mock listings for the main application flow.

